WEBVTT

00:07:57.125 --> 00:08:00.726
As you are sitting here listening to me,

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:03.268
your heart is pumping blood.

00:08:03.292 --> 00:08:05.393
But when you cut that pump,

00:08:05.417 --> 00:08:07.184
the pressure disappears,

00:08:07.208 --> 00:08:09.268
the blood flows to the lower limbs,

00:08:09.292 --> 00:08:11.351
your cheeks sag,

00:08:11.375 --> 00:08:13.268
your face turns gray,

00:08:13.292 --> 00:08:16.434
your bloodless fingers a yellow ivory.

00:08:16.458 --> 00:08:20.476
And the great animating
kern of personality,

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.143
like the ignition on your car,

00:08:22.167 --> 00:08:23.934
is just gone.

00:08:23.958 --> 00:08:26.809
So what happens then, yeah?

00:08:26.833 --> 00:08:28.226
What we shouldn't do

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:30.893
and what our ancestors didn't do,